WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.220 --> 00:01:16.780
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, this 

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:27.250
is going to be a breakdown of all that awesome
new arrow footage.

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:30.560
They’re calling it the High Speed Chase
promo, but really it was all about showing

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:34.880
off some of the secondary characters like
Malcolm Merlyn, Thea, Ray Palmer and Vertigo.

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:38.040
Some of the footage was repeated from the
earlier trailer so I’m just going to focus

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.040
on the new stuff.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:40.040
Also big news, Stephen Amell just revealed
they cast Matt Noble as Ra’s Al Ghul, so

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:41.040
I’ll talk about that after the trailer stuff.

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.240
Starting with said high speed chase.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:45.780
Team Arrow has pretty much been on a winning
streak since they took down Slade.

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:50.540
But here’s the funny part, Felicity as you
can see is working at a Tech village.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.970
Anyone who watched Chuck will enjoy this.

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:57.580
If you didn’t, Brandon Routh’s character
played an evil secret agent.

00:01:57.580 --> 00:01:59.630
Watch it, you’ll have some fun.

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:01.950
It’s on Netflix.

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:04.880
Felicity of course being the Chuck character.

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:17.080
Remember, the Arrow Cave was destroyed in
the finale and Oliver has no money.

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:18.650
Even though it looks like they rebuilt it
somehow.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:23.270
So it looks like she’s working there as
a day job and just hijacking the equipment

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:25.580
to help Oliver with his extracurricular activities.

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:32.390
The other big tease is them dating.

00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:36.950
Since the premiere is when this big Olicity
date goes down, I’m guessing all of these

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:39.670
scenes in the trailer are from that first
episode.

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:46.210
They haven’t been dating all summer, he
just asks her out like was saw in the first

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:47.210
trailer.

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:49.370
So this is just what happens later that night.

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:53.760
I don’t think I know what Felicity’s favorite
food is, besides Pizza.

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:56.550
Everyone’s favorite food is pizza.

00:02:56.550 --> 00:03:00.220
The diggle voice over just explains they’ve
been kicking ass and reducing the crime level

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:01.730
to near zero.

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:05.819
The title of the premiere is “The Calm”,
which means a lot of things, both that crime

00:03:05.819 --> 00:03:19.739
is almost gone, and Calm before 

00:03:19.739 --> 00:03:22.890
the storm.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:27.209
Speaking of storm, here’s a new shot of
peter stormare.

00:03:27.209 --> 00:03:30.720
It shows a finished visual effect of what
he’ll look like when people are tripping

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:35.980
on Vertigo.

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:44.600
I like that they updated this to look even
crazier.

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:49.340
I wonder if they worked the title of the episode
after casting peter stormare, so they could

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:51.860
say the calm before the stormare.

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:54.090
Usually that’s not the way it happens.

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:55.090
It’s probably just a coincidence.

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:59.620
But I like thinking all the writers are laughing
and writing jokes like that.

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:04.209
I love that they follow up new bad guy with
new good guy Ray Palmer.

00:04:04.209 --> 00:04:11.880
He’s the Atom, so we know he’s good, and
he’ll join team arrow at some point.

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:17.799
But when we first meet him, he’ll be yoinking
Oliver’s company and possibly yoinking felicity.

00:04:17.799 --> 00:04:24.420
So he and Oliver will have a really awkward
relationship until they have their bro moment.

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:29.900
Their Broment. which I’m sure will have
something to do with Peter Stormare.

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:33.890
His scene is super quick, but one of the big
things it shows us is how funny season 3 is

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:34.890
going to be.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:39.180
Stephen Amell for example said that he smiled
more in the first episode than he had in all

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:55.470
of seasons 1 and 2 combined.

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:59.280
The whole tone of the show is lightening up
a bit and I think it’s going to make it

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:00.850
a lot more fun to watch.

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:06.310
There’s this big thing going on at DC’s
Film unit where character’s aren’t allowed

00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:07.310
to be super funny.

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:10.790
Like in Batman vs Superman.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:21.470
Thankfully that is not the case for DC TV
Shows.

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:25.710
Adding Brandon Routh as a foil for Stephen
Amell gives so many opportunities for Oliver

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:26.940
to react.

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:32.270
Usually it’s Felicity reacting to him doing
things, but now the power dynamic is shifting

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:33.280
a little.

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:38.490
Ray Palmer owns a tech company that buys a
majority stake in Queen Industries.

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:40.750
So Brandon Routh is now Stephen Amell’s
boss.

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:45.139
But not in the toxic and kind of sexual way
Summer Glau was last year.

00:05:45.139 --> 00:05:49.570
I’m sure tumblr will have some fun with
the Oliver/Summer Glau/Brandon Routh gifsets

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:50.570
though.

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:53.660
Everybody watch out for those.

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:58.210
The new attitude tag again seems mostly about
the secondary characters stepping up.

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:03.790
I keep shipping Laurel as kind of a Kate Spencer
Manhunter analog this year, that’s not exactly

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:04.790
what’s happening.

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:08.430
Really she’s just going to start taking
a page from Oliver’s book and get more hands

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:11.300
on with justice.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.200
Roy of course is in full on sidekick mode.

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.200
Which is really cool.

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:16.650
He was kind of a rage zombie for most of last
year.

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:20.680
The other new footage I’m really excited
about is Thea in training.

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:24.330
As much as I want her to become Artemis, I
think the show will be more ambiguous about

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:29.820
her identity and she’ll just be a more punchy
version of thea.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:32.910
No idea where all this training is happening,
but I’m guessing it’s not in starling

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:33.910
city.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:34.910
I’m really happy for Willa Holland though.

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:46.139
One of the things I’m most looking forward
too is her kicking Roy’s butt a little.

00:06:46.139 --> 00:06:47.139
Merlyn finally appears too.

00:06:47.139 --> 00:06:50.919
I was bummed he hadn’t been in any of the
trailers yet but now it seems like he’s

00:06:50.919 --> 00:06:52.540
hijacking a truck in this shot.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.880
We still don’t know a lot about what his
arc is going to be in season 3.

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:57.410
Or how it will relate to Team Arrow.

00:06:57.410 --> 00:07:06.370
I think of Merlyn as a neutral third party
that will play nice or be bad as a means to

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:07.539
get what he wants.

00:07:07.539 --> 00:07:11.810
So fingers crossed that he and Oliver get
to team up against Ra’s Al Ghul before the

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:12.810
finale.

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:16.600
There will be plenty of them beating the crap
out of each other before that though.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:19.676
The Olicity Date Line: Things You don’t
know about me is just about his time in Hong

00:07:19.676 --> 00:07:20.676
Kong.

00:07:20.676 --> 00:07:22.630
That will probably be what sets off the new
flashback sequences.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:27.530
The only confusing part of the trailer is
Oliver and Roy not in costume fighting military

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:28.530
dudes.

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:32.250
Either this happens on an undercover mission
or it’s part of the big overarching plot.

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:35.509
Like these military people are mercenaries
working for Count Vertigo.

00:07:35.509 --> 00:07:38.400
And these shipping containers are all his
drugs.

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:42.330
But you totally saw it right, Oliver shot
and killed them.

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:46.889
Which is a big left turn from his big ‘not
killing people’ thing in season 2.

00:07:46.889 --> 00:07:51.620
Actually yes, this quiver on roy’s back
makes me think this was an undercover mission.

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:58.870
Episode 1 premieres Wednesday October 8th
at 8PM Eastern Time.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:03.580
If you’re international just adjust based
on time zone.

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:06.440
I know in the UK supposedly you guys get episodes
a little later.

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:10.070
So just adjust your premiere based on the
time between the season 2 US premiere and

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:11.919
when you got Season 2 Episode 1.

00:08:11.919 --> 00:08:14.410
It’ll basically be the same as last year.

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:16.960
The Flash is also premiering Tuesday the 7th.

