00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:35.510
so be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:37.389
Now Ra’s Al Ghul casting.

00:08:37.389 --> 00:08:39.079
This is the other big bomb they dropped.

00:08:39.079 --> 00:08:42.529
Stephen Amell was the one who first announced
it on his twitter.

00:08:42.529 --> 00:08:43.579
Matt Nable is who they picked.

00:08:43.579 --> 00:08:47.470
He’s another aussie, which I think is an
awesome coincidence given Manu Bennett being

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:49.139
the big bad last year.

00:08:49.139 --> 00:08:53.019
Technically Manu was born in New Zealand so
he’s a kiwi, but you get the idea.

00:08:53.019 --> 00:08:57.779
Just imagine the meta thing going on where
Slade is secretly related to Ra’s Al Ghul.

00:08:57.779 --> 00:09:04.529
That’s not true in the comics, but it’s
another point of conversation for tumblr to

00:09:04.529 --> 00:09:07.010
pick up and run with.

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:12.540
Nable you probably remember from Riddick,
the third chronicles of riddick movie.

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:14.029
From a couple years ago.

00:09:14.029 --> 00:09:36.139
Here’s a quick interview clip with him just
so you can get an idea for what he sounds

00:09:36.139 --> 00:09:37.519
like.

00:09:37.519 --> 00:09:38.899
(clip)

00:09:38.899 --> 00:09:45.610
He’ll probably adjust his speech pattern
to suit the Ra’s Al Ghul character, but

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:47.769
I can’t wait to see him unleash on Starling.

00:09:47.769 --> 00:09:51.869
Lots of questions as to why he’s coming
to starling although Malcolm Merlyn, Talia

00:09:51.869 --> 00:09:55.139
al Ghul, Black Canary and Vertigo are all
possible reasons.

00:09:55.139 --> 00:09:59.550
I’m interested to see if Brandon Routh’s
character has any ties to him.

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:01.399
At least within the world of the show.

00:10:01.399 --> 00:10:04.850
In the comics, the Atom doesn’t interact
with Ra’s Al Ghul.

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:13.430
But Arrow has done a good job linking all
of the guest character stories by the finale

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:14.430
each year.

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:17.019
We can talk more about possible connections
in future bonus videos but we are now within

00:10:17.019 --> 00:10:18.920
the 4 week window of the premiere.

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:24.569
So let me know what kind of Arrow/Flash/Constantine
etcetera bonus videos you want to see me do.

00:10:24.569 --> 00:10:30.470
When we get to that week before the premiere,
I’ll be doing extra bonus videos for everything

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:31.470
all the shows.

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:35.939
Since there’s so many shows I want to do
videos for I’m still trying to figure out

00:10:35.939 --> 00:10:38.839
